            <p class="panel-intro">Architecting operational models resilient to cross-border regulatory movements.</p>

            <div class="matrix-grid">
                <div class="matrix-card">
                    <h3>1.1. Who We Are</h3>
                    <ul class="sub-list">
                        <li>Our People</li>
                        <li>Our Mission, Vision & Values</li>
                        <li>Our Drive</li>
                        <li>Ethical Governance</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="matrix-card">
                    <h3>1.2. Our Responsibilities</h3>
                    <ul class="sub-list">
                        <li>Social Impact Structures</li>
                        <li>Environmental Sustainability</li>
                        <li>Economic Corridor Contribution</li>
                        <li>Strategic Integration Merits</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="matrix-card">
                    <h3>1.3. How We Work</h3>
                    <ul class="sub-list">
                        <li>Strategic Partnerships</li>
                        <li>Client Modelling Frameworks</li>
                        <li>Continuous Learning & R&D</li>
                        <li>Media, Press & Corporate Blog</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="themes" class="content-panel">
            <h2>Thought Leadership <span>Channels</span></h2>
            <p class="panel-intro">Publishing data-driven blueprints governing systemic change.</p>

            <div class="matrix-grid">
                <div class="matrix-card">
                    <h3>2.1. Media Vectors</h3>
                    <ul class="sub-list">
                        <li>XYZ Technical Articles</li>
                        <li>XYZ Executive Newsletter</li>
                        <li>XYZ Monthly Bytes Insights</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="matrix-card">
                    <h3>2.2. Strategic Frameworks</h3>
                    <ul class="sub-list">
                        <li>XYZ Change Blueprint</li>
                        <li>Track Record & Global Success Stories</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="industries" class="content-panel">
            <h2>Target Industry <span>Sectors</span></h2>
            <p class="panel-intro">Deploying sector-specific technical compliance systems across the global corridor.</p>

            <div class="matrix-grid">
                <div class="matrix-card">
                    <h3>Consumer & Retail</h3>
                    <ul class="sub-list">
                        <li>FMCG Operational Scales</li>
                        <li>Retail & E-commerce Hubs</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="matrix-card">
                    <h3>Heavy Industry & Energy</h3>
                    <ul class="sub-list">
                        <li>Industrial Manufacturing</li>
                        <li>Energy, Petroleum, Oil & Gas</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="matrix-card">
                    <h3>Logistics & Infrastructure</h3>
                    <ul class="sub-list">
                        <li>Transport Strategy</li>
                        <li>Infrastructure & Real Estate Assets</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="matrix-card">
                    <h3>Public Sector & Civil Society</h3>
                    <ul class="sub-list">
                        <li>Government Systems</li>
                        <li>Education & Non-Profits (NPOs)</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="matrix-card">
                    <h3>Health & Media</h3>
                    <ul class="sub-list">
                        <li>Healthcare & Life Sciences</li>
                        <li>Digital Media & Commerce</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="solutions" class="content-panel">
            <h2>Solutions <span>Ecosystem</span></h2>
            <p class="panel-intro">Deep technical capabilities built for modern regulated markets.</p>

            <div class="matrix-grid">
                <div class="matrix-card">
                    <h3>4.1. Strategy & Transformation</h3>
                    <ul class="sub-list">
                        <li>Digital Transformation</li>
                        <li>Tech Roadmaps & IT Scaling</li>
                        <li>Business-IT Alignment</li>
                        <li>Legacy System Modernisation</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="matrix-card">
                    <h3>4.2. Data, AI & Automation</h3>
                    <ul class="sub-list">
                        <li>Data Strategy & Automation</li>
                        <li>Automated FR Tools</li>
                        <li>Predictive Retail Platforms</li>
                        <li>Generative AI Governance</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="matrix-card">
                    <h3>4.3. Cloud & Infrastructure</h3>
                    <ul class="sub-list">
                        <li>Cloud Optimisation Pipelines</li>
