                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="matrix-card">
                    <h3>4.5. Financial Advisory</h3>
                    <ul class="sub-list">
                        <li>Technical Due Diligence</li>
                        <li>Operational Cost Audits</li>
                        <li>M&A Technical Evaluation</li>
                        <li>IT Asset Valuation Protocols</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="matrix-card">
                    <h3>4.6. Operations & Logistics</h3>
                    <ul class="sub-list">
                        <li>Supply Chain Tracking</li>
                        <li>OP Analysis Models</li>
                        <li>Smart Warehouse Systems</li>
                        <li>Business Process Re-engineering</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="careers" class="content-panel">
            <h2>Human Capital <span>& Culture</span></h2>
            <p class="panel-intro">Join our elite distributed operational consulting teams.</p>

            <div class="matrix-grid">
                <div class="matrix-card">
                    <h3>5.1. Life at DAWHY</h3>
                    <ul class="sub-list">
                        <li>Culture & Core Values</li>
                        <li>Diversity & Global Inclusion</li>
                        <li>Team Benefits & Perks Matrix</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="matrix-card">
                    <h3>5.2. Opportunities</h3>
                    <ul class="sub-list">
                        <li>Search Open Roles</li>
                        <li>Intern & Graduate Pipelines</li>
                        <li>Executive & Experienced Hiring</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="matrix-card">
                    <h3>5.3. Hiring Process</h3>
                    <ul class="sub-list">
                        <li>Recruitment Flow</li>
